      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### The live cluster behind [jithendar.com](https://jithendar.com/)\n\nReal metrics, not a demo: **mk4** is a small k3s cluster on Hetzner (four arm64 nodes) that runs jithendar.com and its projects, with Istio, PostgreSQL, Valkey, GitHub Actions runners and a shared RAG platform (Qdrant, bge-m3 embeddings, Claude through LiteLLM). Read-only, no sign-in, refreshed every minute.\n\n**Explore:** [Kubernetes cluster](/grafana/d/platform-kubernetes) · [Istio mesh](/grafana/d/platform-istio-mesh) · [Istio control plane](/grafana/d/platform-istio-control-plane) · [PostgreSQL](/grafana/d/platform-postgres) · [Valkey (Redis)](/grafana/d/platform-redis) · GitHub Actions runners ([jobs](/grafana/d/platform-github-runners), [pods](/grafana/d/platform-github-runner-pods)) · RAG platform ([overview](/grafana/d/rag-overview), [components](/grafana/d/rag-components), [embeddings](/grafana/d/platform-embeddings)) · [Observability stack](/grafana/d/platform-observability) · [MOKS SRE agent](/grafana/d/moks-overview) · [All dashboards](/grafana/dashboards)\n\nHow it is built and run: the articles on [jithendar.com](https://jithendar.com/).",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
